OL,3,AFirst minister demands 'new deal' from
OL,4,AAndy Burnham to make Wales equal with
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth has
OL,8,Fdemanded a "new deal" for Wales from
OL,9,Fthe UK government that would put the
OL,10,Fcountry on an equal footing with
OL,11,FScotland.
OL,13,FIn a letter he said powers over
OL,14,Fpolicing, justice, rail and the Crown
OL,15,FEstate should be transferred to
OL,16,FCardiff.
OL,18,FSpeaking at Plaid Cymru's conference in
OL,19,FLlandudno, the party's leader said
OL,20,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,21,Fpromised him he would not undermine
OL,22,FWales.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
